{'symbol': 'D', 'date': '2022-08-08 07:30:00', 'title': 'DOMINION ENERGY ANNOUNCES SECOND-QUARTER 2022 EARNINGS', 'text': 'SECOND-QUARTER 2022 GAAP REPORTED NET LOSS OF $0.58 PER SHARE SECOND-QUARTER 2022 OPERATING EARNINGS OF $0.77 PER SHARE COMPANY INITIATES THIRD-QUARTER 2022 OPERATING EARNINGS GUIDANCE OF $0.98 TO $1.13 PER SHARE COMPANY AFFIRMS FULL-YEAR 2022 OPERATING EARNINGS GUIDANCE AS WELL AS OTHER LONG-TERM EARNINGS AND DIVIDEND GUIDANCE RICHMOND, VA. , AUG. 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DOMINION ENERGY (NYSE: D) TODAY ANNOUNCED AN UNAUDITED NET LOSS DETERMINED IN ACCORDANCE WITH GENERALLY ACCEPTED ACCOUNTING PRINCIPLES (REPORTED EARNINGS) FOR THE THREE MONTHS ENDED JUNE 30, 2022, OF $453 MILLION ($0.58 PER SHARE) COMPARED WITH NET INCOME OF $285 MILLION ($0.33 PER SHARE) FOR THE SAME PERIOD IN 2021.'}